<details class="fmstr-cmp-ftq-faq__item">
<summary>What&rsquo;s the difference between trivia and a quiz?</summary>
<div class="fmstr-cmp-ftq-faq__answer">Trivia is usually general-knowledge questions with no scoring stakes; a quiz is a scored format. The Formester template runs as a scored quiz so you get a leaderboard automatically; disable scoring if you just want laughs.</div>
</details>
<details class="fmstr-cmp-ftq-faq__item">
<summary>Where can I find a free printable trivia quiz PDF?</summary>
