<div class="fmstr-cmp-ftq-faq__answer">Open the <a href="https://formester.com/ai-quiz-maker/">AI Quiz Maker</a>, paste a topic or upload a PDF, and the model drafts the questions. Review, edit, share. The <a href="https://formester.com/blog/best-ai-quiz-generators/">best AI quiz generators</a> blog compares it to other tools.</div>
